{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worn By The Forgotten</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card-based adventure game where every step \u2014 and every card you play \u2014 shapes your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Worn By The Forgotten, you are Worn, chosen by a divine mask to traverse a broken world. Explore handcrafted levels, gather fragments of forgotten masks, and build your own deck of abilities to overcome diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are more than attacks. Use them to fight enemies, sneak past patrols, create diversions, or even manipulate the environment. Every level offers multiple approaches, and the way you combine movement, cards, and limited resources determines your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recovering masks unlocks entirely new decks, giving you fresh tools and strategies for the trials ahead. Between missions, customize your deck, upgrade your abilities, and prepare for the journey into the heart of Janustan\u2019s domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Card System</strong> \u2013 Build and adapt your deck with unique cards tied to each mask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploratory Adventure</strong> \u2013 Move freely through handcrafted stages with multiple solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Choices</strong> \u2013 Combat, stealth, and creative card use make every encounter unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Unlocks</strong> \u2013 Gain new masks, cards, and upgrades to shape your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915630?t=1756297908","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3915630?t=1756297908","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915630/8839efa272c17d5f6fd253c5032a5932d0ddd860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756297908","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915630/8839efa272c17d5f6fd253c5032a5932d0ddd860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756297908","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worn By The Forgotten</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A card-based adventure game where every step \u2014 and every card you play \u2014 shapes your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Worn By The Forgotten, you are Worn, chosen by a divine mask to traverse a broken world. Explore handcrafted levels, gather fragments of forgotten masks, and build your own deck of abilities to overcome diverse challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards are more than attacks. Use them to fight enemies, sneak past patrols, create diversions, or even manipulate the environment. Every level offers multiple approaches, and the way you combine movement, cards, and limited resources determines your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recovering masks unlocks entirely new decks, giving you fresh tools and strategies for the trials ahead. Between missions, customize your deck, upgrade your abilities, and prepare for the journey into the heart of Janustan\u2019s domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Card System</strong> \u2013 Build and adapt your deck with unique cards tied to each mask.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploratory Adventure</strong> \u2013 Move freely through handcrafted stages with multiple solutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Choices</strong> \u2013 Combat, stealth, and creative card use make every encounter unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Unlocks</strong> \u2013 Gain new masks, cards, and upgrades to shape your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["OddBallGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915630/6915baf000e50f2edb51e073e7d67ad146a2762b/header.jpg?t=1756297908","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257189546,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189546/movie480.mp4?t=1756297906","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189546/movie_max.mp4?t=1756297906"},"name":"\uc608\uace0\ud3b8","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189546/1c88f8873aba5f373c4d94a8d443b5dd63a9fddb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756297906","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189546/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756297906","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257189546/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756297906"}}],"name":"Worn By The Forgotten","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-9600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["OddBallGames"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"1